Source: sv-armory-network
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Maintainer: z1rov <fabian@zirov.net>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0

Package: sv-armory-network
Architecture: all
Depends: svent-core, curl, ca-certificates, unzip, gzip, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Svent network armory (Windows pivoting binaries downloader)
 Downloads Windows pivoting/tunneling binaries (chisel.exe, ligolo agent and
 proxy, netcat, plink, putty) into /usr/share/armory/network for uploading to
 compromised Windows hosts. Fetched from upstream projects at install time.
